sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-specimen-match> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-specimen-match-1> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py L1272–L1302" ;
        dcterms:description "Panel F: radiograph with Digit II-IV centerlines and MCP/PIP/DIP markers; Panel D overlays segmented digits on the Kavanagh morphospace (L1185-1246)" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py#L1272-L1302> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-specimen-match-2> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py L1154–L1184" ;
        dcterms:description "Panel C: motile WT cavities vs paralysed (interzones, no cavities, Sox9 re-expressed) vs Nog-/- fused rod, visually distinct" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py#L1154-L1184> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-specimen-match-3> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "docs/media/joint_interzone_clefting_cavitation.png (generated output)" ;
        dcterms:description "Rendered Pass 3 figure: lens cavities in the pressure field (A), midline gate (B), three literature conditions (C), loading and permeability sweeps (D-E), joint-line arch vs radiograph (F); the model head contour in F is flat while the specimen joint lines are convex-head — docs/media/joint_interzone_clefting_cavitation.png: rendered output of 2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py at d58a084, image/png, 658959 B, 2610×1566 px, artifact_sha256 c612dc93112543210b81219fca8621a571a5442530950912526abe3aad3d8830 (sha256 c612dc93112543210b81219fca8621a571a5442530950912526abe3aad3d8830), spec_fingerprint 1d288d48a8d6a46b269ac8c181dfcb21e621b3dfef13912fa8b3a56d847f9a0e" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-specimen-match-4> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "docs/media/joint_interzone_clefting_growth.gif (generated output)" ;
        dcterms:description "Growth GIF regenerated; shows sequential MCP -> PIP -> DIP interzone clefting but not the Pass 3 cavitation (cavities are only in the PNGs) — docs/media/joint_interzone_clefting_growth.gif: rendered output of 2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py at d58a084, image/gif, 1503309 B, 1166×473 px, 14 frames, artifact_sha256 1aad6f5f5b4845ae3a6036999466646da0c07b0b9ff4402f8c0de339cec3d9d8 (sha256 1aad6f5f5b4845ae3a6036999466646da0c07b0b9ff4402f8c0de339cec3d9d8), spec_fingerprint 1d288d48a8d6a46b269ac8c181dfcb21e621b3dfef13912fa8b3a56d847f9a0e" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-specimen-match-5> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py L869–L948" ;
        dcterms:description "Specimen joint-line arch trace with contrast gate; 4/6 joints valid, 3/4 convex-head sign, mean s/c 0.056 +/- 0.078" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py#L869-L948> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Kavanagh et al. (2013) phalangeal Inhibitory Cascade & Hiscock et al. (2017) BMP-GDF5-Noggin synovial joint interzone segmentation, with Pass 3 reduced Biot poroelastic synovial cavitation — Morphological realism / specimen match: 84/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Credited: the comparison PNG shows the radiograph with traced centerlines and MCP/PIP/DIP markers beside the Kavanagh morphospace (Panels D, F), and the new Panel C / cavitation figure make the WT lens cavities, the paralysed uncavitated interzones and the Nog-/- rod visually distinct; the new joint-line arch trace agrees in sign with 3 of 4 valid joints (s/c 0.064 vs 0.056). Deductions: the specimen is a juvenile hand radiograph with open physes — the \"interzone clefts\" are adult joint spaces 10-12 px from a growth plate, not embryonic interzones (-5); Digit II's centerline has no bone contrast over its distal half (profile ~67 flat), so its DIP minimum is window-determined and it fails the Pass 3 contrast gate (L1019-1023) (-4); `n_synovial_clefts: 3` is asserted, not detected (L1053) (-3); the modelled proximal head contour is flat (head sagitta/half-span -0.036) because the lens thickening cancels the arch, whereas the radiograph heads are convex (-3); the joint-line statistic has sd 0.078 > mean 0.056 on n = 4 (-1)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/specimen-match" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py L1019–L1023: PIP/DIP minima are argmin within hand-set window fractions; Digit II's distal profile has no bone contrast so its DIP is window-determined <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py#L1019-L1023>",
            "2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py L1053–L1053: `n_synovial_clefts: 3` is a constant, not a detection result <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py#L1053-L1053>",
            "datasets/joint_interzone_clefting/README.md L10–L10: Specimen is a juvenile radiograph with open physes (disclosed in Pass 3, not an embryonic interzone) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/datasets/joint_interzone_clefting/README.md#L10-L10>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-specimen-match-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-specimen-match-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-specimen-match-3>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-specimen-match-4>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-specimen-match-5> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.84"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> a pk:Model ;
